# Purpose

This document defines the deployment engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to ensure software is delivered safely, consistently, and predictably while preserving platform stability, business continuity, and engineering confidence.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Deployment philosophy
* Release architecture
* Deployment consistency
* Operational safety
* Deployment governance
* Platform evolution

It intentionally excludes deployment platforms, CI/CD tooling, infrastructure configuration, cloud providers, and implementation-specific release automation, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to software delivery, ensuring deployments remain reliable, repeatable, and aligned with the long-term evolution of the platform.

